---
description: Ingot UI rules (look and feel, tokens, shortcuts)
globs: packages/**/src/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Match docs/design/ide-reference.png: main toolbar, tool window stripes, compact density, 13px UI font, 20px tool window icons.
- Every action has a command id, an Ingot default shortcut (see keymap constants) and appears in Find Action (Cmd+Shift+A).
- Colors only via design tokens (`--ingot-*`); support Ingot Light, Ingot Dark and System themes.
- Every user-facing feature ships with a Playwright e2e spec that drives it with real clicks and shortcuts.
- Extensions come from Open VSX only.
